%% PoRedoImage — Request Flow (SIMPLE)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant WASM as Blazor WASM Client
    participant BFF as BFF Host (PoRedoImage.Web)
    participant API as Minimal API MapGroup
    participant Ext as Azure Table/Blob + AI providers

    User->>WASM: Upload photo
    WASM->>BFF: POST /api/... + X-Session-ID + X-Correlation-ID<br/>HttpOnly cookie
    BFF->>BFF: Correlation, rate limit, authN, authZ (fail-closed)
    BFF->>API: Routed to the feature slice
    API->>API: Validate DTO + idempotency key
    API->>Ext: Orchestrator calls storage and AI
    Ext-->>API: Result
    API-->>WASM: 200 + echoed correlation headers
    WASM-->>User: Rendered result
